Privacy Policy for Aura Fly

Last Updated: October 6, 2026 

Your privacy is important to us. It is Aura Fly's policy to respect your privacy regarding any information we may collect while operating our mobile application.

1. Information We Collect

• Personal Data: Aura Fly does not require user accounts, email registration, or passwords to function. We do not collect, store, or transmit any personally identifiable information (PII) to external servers.
• Device Permissions: The application may request standard system permissions (such as local location access or notifications) solely to enable native features on your device. This data is processed in your device's local memory and is never uploaded or shared.

2. How We Use Information
Any data utilized by the app remains entirely on your local device. We use this data strictly to:
• Provide and maintain the application's core functions.
• Deliver local notifications or alerts configured by you.
• Optimize app performance on your specific mobile hardware.

3. Third-Party Services
Aura Fly does not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your information to outside parties. The app does not integrate hidden third-party tracking frameworks, data brokers, or targeted advertising analytics.

4. Data Security
We prioritize security by utilizing standard on-device sandboxing protocols provided by the operating system (iOS/Android). Because we do not transmit or collect your data over the internet to centralized cloud databases, your data is secure from remote server-side breaches.
